 href=\"/locations\">Locations</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"padding: 8px 15px; color:white;\">Contact Us</a></li>\n                </ul>\n            </nav>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Hero Section -->\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>Expert Cold Room Repair Services Rajkot</h1>\n            <p>Reliable maintenance and emergency repair for industrial cold storage, food processing units, and engineering chillers. Serving Metoda GIDC, Shapar Veraval, Aji GIDC, and all Rajkot areas.</p>\n            <div style=\"margin-top: 25px;\">\n                <a href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141?text=I%20need%20Cold%20Room%20Repair%20Service%20in%20Rajkot\" class=\"btn btn-whatsapp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"white\"><path d=\"M.057 24l1.687-6.163c-1.041-1.804-1.588-3.849-1.587-5.946.003-6.556 5.338-11.891 11.893-11.891 3.181.001 6.167 1.24 8.413 3.488 2.245 2.248 3.481 5.236 3.48 8.414-.003 6.557-5.338 11.892-11.893 11.892-1.99-.001-3.951-.5-5.688-1.448l-6.305 1.654zm6.597-3.807c1.676.995 3.276 1.591 5.392 1.592 5.448 0 9.886-4.434 9.889-9.885.002-5.462-4.415-9.89-9.881-9.892-5.452 0-9.887 4.434-9.889 9.884-.001 2.225.651 3.891 1.746 5.634l-.999 3.648 3.742-.981zm11.387-5.464c-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347-.297-.149-1.758-868-2.031-.967-.272-.099-.47-.149-.669.149-.198.297-.768.967-.941 1.165-.173.198-.347.223-.644.074-.297-.149-1.255-.462-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.297-.347.446-.521.151-.172.2-.296.3-.495.099-.198.05-.372-.025-.521-.075-.148-.669-1.611-.916-2.206-.242-.579-.487-.501-.669-.51l-.57-.01c-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372s-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 1.065 2.876 1.213 3.074c.149.198 2.095 3.2 5.076 4.487.709.306 1.263.489 1.694.626.712.226 1.36.194 1.872.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.695.248-1.29.173-1.414z\"/></svg>\n                    Chat on WhatsApp\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"margin-left: 10px;\">Call Now</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Introduction with Focus Keyword -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"flex\" style=\"align-items: center; gap: 40px;\">\n                <div style=\"flex: 1;\">\n                    <h2>Best Cold Room Repair Services Rajkot</h2>\n                    <p>As the engineering and automotive hub of Saurashtra, Rajkot requires robust cooling support. At Atlas Aircon, we specialize in <strong>Cold Room Repair Services Rajkot</strong>, ensuring your industrial processes and food storage systems run without interruption. Whether you operate a foundry in <strong>Aji GIDC</strong>, an auto-part unit in <strong>Metoda</strong>, or a food processing plant in <strong>Shapar Veraval</strong>, our expert technicians are just a call away.</p>\n                    <p>We provide comprehensive solutions including gas leak detection, compressor maintenance, and panel repairs. Our <strong class=\"bold-keyword\">Cold Room Repair Services Rajkot</strong> are trusted by local businesses for ensuring minimal downtime in a high-demand industrial environment.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"flex: 1;\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/cold-room-repair-service.webp\" alt=\"Cold Room Repair Services Rajkot Technician\" style=\"width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\" title=\"\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Services We Offer / Types of Repair -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding\" style=\"background: var(--light-bg);\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-center\">Types of Cooling Systems We Repair</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-center\" style=\"max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 40px;\">We provide comprehensive solutions for industrial and commercial refrigeration needs in Rajkot.</p>\n            \n            <div class=\"grid\">\n                <!-- Service 1 -->\n                <div class=\"service-card\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/cold-room.webp\" alt=\"Walk-in Cold Room Repair Rajkot\" title=\"\">\n                    <h3>Walk-in Cold Rooms</h3>\n                    <p>Complete diagnostics for positive and negative temperature walk-in chambers. We fix door seals, hinges, and cooling units efficiently.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/cold-room-repair-services-rajkot\" style=\"color:var(--primary-blue); font-weight:bold;\">Learn More &rarr;</a>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Service 2 -->\n                <div class=\"service-card\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/deep-freezer-repair-service-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"Deep Freezer Repair Services Rajkot\" title=\"\">\n                    <h3>Deep Freezers &#038; Blast Freezers</h3>\n                    <p>Specialized repair for blast freezers used in food processing. We ensure rapid cooling cycles are restored to preserve quality.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/deep-freezer-repair-services-rajkot\" style=\"color:var(--primary-blue); font-weight:bold;\">Learn More &rarr;</a>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Service 3 -->\n                <div class=\"service-card\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Cold-Room-Gas-Charging.webp\" alt=\"Cold Room Gas Charging Service\" title=\"\">\n                    <h3>Gas Charging &#038; Leak Repair</h3>\n                    <p>Detection of refrigerant leaks using advanced tools. We refill R404A, R22, and R134a gases for optimal cooling performance.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Service 4 -->\n                <div class=\"service-card\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Walkin-Freezer-Repair-Service.webp\" alt=\"Industrial Chiller Repair Rajkot\" title=\"\">\n                    <h3>Industrial Chillers</h3>\n                    <p>Specialized maintenance for process chillers used in plastic molding and engineering industries to maintain equipment temperature.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Brands We Service -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2>Brands We Service</h2>\n            <p>We provide expert third-party service for a wide range of local and international refrigeration brands. <em>Note: We are an independent service provider.</em></p>\n            <div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 15px; margin-top: 20px;\">\n                <span class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#eee; color:#333; cursor:default;\">Voltas</span>\n                <span class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#eee; color:#333; cursor:default;\">Blue Star</span>\n                <span class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#eee; color:#333; cursor:default;\">Carrier</span>\n                <span class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#eee; color:#333; cursor:default;\">Bitzer (Compressors)</span>\n                <span class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#eee; color:#333; cursor:default;\">Copeland</span>\n                <span class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#eee; color:#333; cursor:default;\">Danfoss</span>\n                <span class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#eee; color:#333; cursor:default;\">Rinac</span>\n                <span class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#eee; color:#333; cursor:default;\">Lloyd</span>\n                <span class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#eee; color:#333; cursor:default;\">Emerson</span>\n                <span class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#eee; color:#333; cursor:default;\">Frick India</span>\n                <span class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#eee; color:#333; cursor:default;\">Alfa Laval</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Industrial Focus Section -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding\" style=\"background: #eef2f5;\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"flex\" style=\"align-items: center; gap: 40px; flex-direction: row-reverse;\">\n                <div style=\"flex: 1;\">\n                    <h2>Specialized Service for Rajkot, Shapar &#038; Metoda GIDC</h2>\n                    <p>Industries in Rajkot require robust cooling systems that can withstand heavy usage. Atlas Aircon provides priority <strong>Cold Room Repair Services Rajkot</strong> for the district&#8217;s industrial hubs. We understand the specific needs of casting units in <strong>Aji GIDC</strong>, engineering factories in <strong>Shapar Veraval</strong>, and large-scale manufacturing in <strong>Metoda GIDC</strong>.</p>\n                    <ul style=\"list-style: none; margin-top: 15px;\">\n                        <li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">✅ <strong>Rapid Response:</strong> Technicians serving Metoda, Shapar, and Aji Industrial Areas.</li>\n                        <li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">✅ <strong>AMC Services:</strong> Preventive maintenance contracts to ensure consistent cooling in harsh industrial environments.</li>\n                        <li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">✅ <strong>Heavy Duty Repair:</strong> Handling scroll and screw compressors for industrial applications.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                    <a href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"margin-top: 20px;\">Request GIDC Service</a>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"flex: 1;\">\n                    <!-- Fallback SVG for industrial visual -->\n                    <div style=\"background: white; padding: 40px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px;\">\n                        <svg width=\"100\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"var(--dark-blue)\">\n                            <path d=\"M11 7l-3.2 9h1.9l.7-2h3.2l.7 2h1.9L13 7h-2zm-.15 5.65L12 9l1.15 3.65h-2.3zM22 4h-1V2h-2v2h-1c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v12c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h4c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V6c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm-4 12h-2v-2h2v2zm0-4h-2V8h2v4zM7.5 17l-1.41-1.41L7.59 14.17 6.17 12.76 4.76 14.17 3.34 12.76 1.93 14.17 3.34 15.59 1.93 17l1.41 1.41L4.76 17l1.41 1.41L7.59 17l1.41 1.41L10.41 17l-2.91-2.91zM20 6h-6V4h6v2z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                        <p style=\"margin-top: 15px; font-weight: bold; color: var(--text-light);\">Industrial Cooling Solutions</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Pricing Table -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2>Cold Room Service Price List in Rajkot</h2>\n            <p>Transparent pricing for high-quality repairs. Prices may vary based on spare parts and capacity.</p>\n            <table class=\"price-table\">\n                <thead>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th>Service Description</th>\n                        <th>Estimated Price Range</th>\n                        <th>Book Now</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>General Servicing (Cleaning &#038; Checkup)</td>\n                        <td>₹1,500 &#8211; ₹3,500</td>\n                        <td><a href=\"/shop\" style=\"color:var(--primary-blue);\">View Details</a></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Gas Charging (Per Kg)</td>\n                        <td>₹2,500 &#8211; ₹4,500</td>\n                        <td><a href=\"/shop\" style=\"color:var(--primary-blue);\">View Details</a></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Compressor Replacement (Labor)</td>\n                        <td>₹5,000 &#8211; ₹8,000</td>\n                        <td><a href=\"/shop\" style=\"color:var(--primary-blue);\">View Details</a></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Digital Controller Repair/Replace</td>\n                        <td>₹3,000 &#8211; ₹6,500</td>\n                        <td><a href=\"/shop\" style=\"color:var(--primary-blue);\">View Details</a></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Door Seal/Gasket Replacement</td>\n                        <td>₹1,200 &#8211; ₹2,500</td>\n                        <td><a href=\"/shop\" style=\"color:var(--primary-blue);\">View Details</a></td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p><small>*Note: Prices are indicative. Spare parts like compressors, expansion valves, and driers are charged extra at actuals.</small></p>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Spare Parts Section -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding\" style=\"background: #f4f7f6;\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2>Genuine Cold Room Spare Parts Store</h2>\n            <p>Looking for high-quality spares? We stock a wide range of components for all cold room brands. Order online for fast delivery in Rajkot &#038; Shapar.</p>\n            <div class=\"spares-grid\">\n                <a href=\"/capacitor\" class=\"spare-card\">Capacitors</a>\n                <a href=\"/complete-coil-assembly\" class=\"spare-card\">Complete Coil</a>\n                <a href=\"/contactors\" class=\"spare-card\">Contactor</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"spare-card\">Electric/Pneumatic Actuators</a>\n                <a href=\"/fan-blades\" class=\"spare-card\">Fan Blade</a>\n                <a href=\"/fan-motors\" class=\"spare-card\">Fan Motor</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Pros & Cons -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding\" style=\"background: var(--light-bg);\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2>Why Maintain Your Cold Room? (Pros &#038; Cons)</h2>\n            <div class=\"pros-cons-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"pros\">\n                    <h3>Advantages of Regular Maintenance</h3>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li>Extended equipment lifespan (up to 5 years more).</li>\n                        <li>Reduced energy bills by up to 20%.</li>\n                        <li>Prevention of costly emergency breakdowns.</li>\n                        <li>Maintains consistent temperature for product safety.</li>\n                        <li>Complies with food safety and pharmaceutical regulations.</li>\n                        <li>Quieter operation and less vibration.</li>\n                        <li>Higher resale value of equipment.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"cons\">\n                    <h3>Risks of Neglecting Service</h3>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li>High risk of compressor burnout.</li>\n                        <li>Spoilage of expensive inventory (food/medicine).</li>\n                        <li>Increased electricity consumption.</li>\n                        <li>Frequent gas leakages.</li>\n                        <li>Ice formation on evaporator coils.</li>\n                        <li>Unexpected downtime during peak season.</li>\n                        <li>Safety hazards from electrical malfunctions.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Error Codes -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2>Common Cold Room Error Codes &#038; Solutions</h2>\n            <p>Before calling us, check your controller display. Here are common codes for Dixell, Subzero, and Danfoss controllers:</p>\n            <div class=\"grid\">\n                <div style=\"background: #fff; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">\n                    <h4>Code: E1 / P1</h4>\n                    <p><strong>Meaning:</strong> Room Probe Failure.</p>\n                    <p><strong>Solution:</strong> Check sensor connection or replace NTC probe.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"background: #fff; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">\n                    <h4>Code: HA / Hi</h4>\n                    <p><strong>Meaning:</strong> High Temperature Alarm.</p>\n                    <p><strong>Solution:</strong> Check if door is open, condenser is dirty, or gas is low.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"background: #fff; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">\n                    <h4>Code: LA / Lo</h4>\n                    <p><strong>Meaning:</strong> Low Temperature Alarm.</p>\n                    <p><strong>Solution:</strong> Compressor contactor might be stuck on. Turn off immediately.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Areas Served -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding\" style=\"background: var(--white);\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2>Areas We Serve in Rajkot District</h2>\n            <p>We provide doorstep <strong class=\"bold-keyword\">Cold Room Repair Services Rajkot</strong> across all neighborhoods, towns, and industrial zones.</p>\n            \n            <div class=\"area-section\">\n                <h3>🏭 Industrial Areas &#038; GIDC</h3>\n                <div class=\"area-list\">\n                    Metoda GIDC (Lodhika) | Shapar Veraval Industrial Area | Aji GIDC Phase 1, 2, 3 | Samrat Industrial Area | Atika Industrial Area | Bhaktinagar GIDC | Kuchiyadad | Kuvadva GIDC | Hadamtala Industrial Zone | Gondal Road Industrial Area.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"area-section\">\n                <h3>🏠 Residential &#038; Commercial Areas</h3>\n                <div class=\"area-list\">\n                    Kalavad Road | 150 Feet Ring Road | University Road | Yagnik Road | Amin Marg | Raiya Road | Nana Mava | Mota Mava | Mavdi | Kothariya | Gondal Road | Bhaktinagar | Gandhigram | Sadar Bazar | Junction Plot | Race Course Ring Road | Limda Chowk.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FAQ Section -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding\" style=\"background: var(--light-bg);\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">1. How much does a cold room service visit cost in Rajkot?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Visiting charges typically start from ₹500 within Rajkot city, Metoda, and Shapar. Repair costs depend on the diagnosis.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">2. Do you repair industrial chillers for engineering units?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Yes, we specialize in repairing industrial chillers and refrigeration systems used in casting, forging, and auto-part manufacturing processes.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">3. What happens if my cold room compressor fails at night?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Atlas Aircon offers emergency support for contracted clients in Rajkot, Metoda, and Shapar. Call us immediately at +91 97272 57141.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">4. Do you provide warranty on spare parts?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Yes, we provide manufacturer warranty on replaced parts like compressors, controllers, and motors.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">5. Can you repair cold room doors and latches?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Absolutely. We repair door gaskets, hinges, latches, and sliding door mechanisms to prevent cooling loss.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">6. Why is ice forming on my cold room evaporator coil?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">This could be due to a faulty defrost timer, heater failure, or low gas pressure. We can diagnose and fix this.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">7. Which areas do you cover outside Rajkot?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">We serve nearby industrial hubs including Gondal, Jasdan, Padhari, and Tankara.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">8. How often should a cold room be serviced?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">For commercial usage, we recommend preventive maintenance every 3 months to ensure efficiency.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">9. Do you repair Rittal Panel ACs?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Yes, we service panel ACs for CNC machines and server rooms in industrial areas. Check our Panel AC service page.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">10. What payment methods do you accept?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">We accept Cash, UPI, Bank Transfer, and Cheques for corporate clients.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Other Services Links -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h3>Explore Our Other Cooling Services</h3>\n            <div class=\"flex\" style=\"gap: 15px; margin-top: 20px;\">\n                <a href=\"/air-cooler-repair-services-rajkot\" class=\"btn\" style=\"border:1px solid #ddd;\">Air Cooler Repair</a>\n                <a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-rajkot\" class=\"btn\" style=\"border:1px solid #ddd;\">Chiller Repair</a>\n                <a href=\"/central-ac-repair-services-rajkot\" class=\"btn\" style=\"border:1px solid #ddd;\">Central AC Repair</a>\n                <a href=\"/deep-freezer-repair-services-rajkot\" class=\"btn\" style=\"border:1px solid #ddd;\">Deep Freezer Repair</a>\n                <a href=\"/refrigerator-repair-services-rajkot\" class=\"btn\" style=\"border:1px solid #ddd;\">Refrigerator Repair</a>\n                <a href=\"/ducting-repair-services-rajkot\" class=\"btn\" style=\"border:1px solid #ddd;\">Ducting Repair</a>\n                <a href=\"/hvac-repair-services-rajkot\" class=\"btn\" style=\"border:1px solid #ddd;\">HVAC Repair</a>\n                <a href=\"/panel-ac-service-rajkot\" class=\"btn\" style=\"border:1px solid #ddd;\">Panel AC Service</a>\n                <a href=\"/water-cooler-repair-services-rajkot\" class=\"btn\" style=\"border:1px solid #ddd;\">Water Cooler Repair</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <footer>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"grid\" style=\"grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));\">\n                <div>\n                    <h4>About Atlas Aircon</h4>\n                    <p>Your trusted partner for all industri